{
  "name": "Walking Catastrophe",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your transformation embodies the vast size and terror of nature's titans. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Supreme Titan Form.</strong> You can choose to become Gargantuan when assuming your Titan Form. Each Titan Form also gains an additional benefit, as noted in its respective stat block.</p><p><strong>Greater Primal Infusion.</strong> When you use Primal Infusion, you can expend a level 5+ spell slot instead to increase your Strength and Constitution by 4 for the duration of your Titan Form.</p>",
